body:
Coordinator, merge note for head d563eecb2b065752a50480c211eb55061627e051. Class: no refresh (the head is the reviewed head).

This merge relies on:
- the review marker on this head (23:18Z) and the read-only second read (no blocker: no program that posted before is refused on a shipped post);
- a trial merge here, on `main` 69997a6de (the merge is clean; 12 files; no `.nc` file and no file under `examples/`):
  - the whole post crate: 123 steps, with `upright_after_tilt` 13 passed and `mach4_trunnion`;
  - 37 app suites of the quick plan: `conformance`, `posting`, `posting_rotaries_first`, `first_part_programs` 2, the three example catalog suites (37, 1, 1), `first_4axis_part`, `continuous_4axis_part`, `tilt_basis_compat`, `catalog_groove_part_off`, `first_router_part`, and each `first_traverse`, `rotary`, `tormach`, `doosan`, `mach4`, `c_axis`, `opening`, `tilt` and `index` suite;
  - the app lib 298 passed and `golden_cl` 33 passed;
  - together 162 gate steps, 0 failed; clippy on `camcraft-post` with all targets and on the `camcraft-app` lib is clean; no golden changed.

Not run: 80 other app suites of the quick plan (242 steps), and the light lane (its three steps are motion twins; this PR changes no motion code). The heavy lanes are not a merge condition (#3556).

`main` moved after the trial by #2847 (a geometry library that no code calls).
